Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:36:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: Enable Wi-Fi debug mode with runit when booted with it

Wi-Fi debug mode restarted iwd with a systemd drop-in that adds -d. On
runit, Void Linux's iwd service reads its options from /etc/sv/iwd/conf,
so the same option goes there, in a file marked as steamos-manager's; an
administrator's own conf is left alone. iwd is restarted through the init
system's service. systemd systems are unchanged.
